				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kejani-hammerborn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5952266); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5952266&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606316074" alt="Kejani Hammerborn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5952266)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kejani-hammerborn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5952266); return false;" >Kejani Hammerborn</a></span> <span class="odate time_1605734013 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">18 Nov 2020 21:13</span>
