			<div class="content" id="post-content-4821899">
									

<p>A fungal infection that eats/consumes non-synthetic solids, and reanimates some mammals. Originates from alternate dimension.</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/kejani-hammerborn" target="_blank">Kejani Hammerborn - The Consuming Mould</a></span></p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Word Count:</span> ~8.5k</p>
<p>Hello! I would appreciate it if anyone could review and critique my first ever written SCP! It's under the tab labelled &#8220;The Consuming Mould&#8221;. I've been working on it on and off for a while, so there's a possibility that some areas are incoherent as my ideas changed over time. If there is anything that I can do better, please let me know. And, of course, any grammatical errors. Thank you!</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Greenlight Evidence:</span><br />
&#8220;Hm. I'm gonna tentatively <span style="color: green">greenlight</span> this&#8221; <sub><a href="https://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cybersqyd" target="_blank">-Cybersqyd</a></sub></p>
<p>&#8220;Critted via IRC; <span style="color: green"><strong>greenlighted</strong></span>.&#8221; <sub><a href="https://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nagiros" target="_blank">-Nagiros</a></sub></p>

							</div>

